identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","abstract":[],"title":"Cliques","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/cliques"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"title":"MaximalCliques","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","abstract":[{"text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"degeneracy d.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}]},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/prefix(_:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"prefix"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s14PrefixSequenceV","text":"PrefixSequence"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/prefix(_:)","title":"prefix(_:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/prefix(_:)"}}}